{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Make the videos a site's plan asks for"},"description":"[40 credits] Per video started. One filmed video per get_site_plan idea without one (or the idea_ids given), of its verified page with its sourced brief as focus. Without confirm it lists what it would make and the cost, capped at the balance (the rest under needs_credits), creating nothing; confirm=true starts those. get_video reports each. A retry never starts an idea twice.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"aspect_ratio":{"default":"16:9","description":"As create_video.","enum":["16:9","9:16","1:1","4:5"],"type":"string"},"brand_name":{"description":"Name shown on the intro and outro cards.","maxLength":60,"type":"string"},"caption_style":{"description":"As create_video.","enum":["karaoke","bold","boxed","minimal","outline"],"type":"string"},"confirm":{"default":false,"description":"false (the default) previews the videos and spends nothing. true starts them and spends 40 credits each.","type":"boolean"},"idea_ids":{"description":"Which ideas from get_site_plan to make, in order. Omitted: every idea that has no video yet.","items":{"type":"string"},"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"intro":{"default":true,"description":"Include the branded opening title card.","type":"boolean"},"language":{"default":"en","description":"As create_video.","type":"string"},"look":{"default":"auto","description":"As create_video.","enum":["clean","bold","editorial","playful","tech","auto"],"type":"string"},"max_videos":{"default":5,"description":"At most this many videos in one call. Call again for the rest.","maximum":10,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"music":{"default":"auto","description":"As create_video.","type":"string"},"outro":{"default":true,"description":"As create_video.","type":"boolean"},"site_url":{"description":"Any public htt